{"game": "roboquest", "language": "english", "appid": 692890, "month": "2025-02", "window": 3, "start_date": 1739577600, "end_date": 1740182399, "month_true_total": 136, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-03 01:54:50 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "188439641", "author": {"steamid": "76561198969057416", "personaname": "hebel", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198969057416/", "num_games_owned": 104, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 948, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 948, "last_played": 1738004511, "avatar": "87e29f3bd29d9856a6b3e539993cf457ce9c3ea4"}, "language": "english", "review": "A fine fps experience, it  does gets really tedious at a certain point, but is one of those games that reward you for everything you put towards it. and it doesn't punish you for playing singleplayer which is nice,", "timestamp_created": 1740170939, "timestamp_updated": 1740170939, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188435480", "author": {"steamid": "76561197988871571", "personaname": "Seral", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197988871571/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 22, "playtime_forever": 1319, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1319, "last_played": 1740166998, "avatar": "0717288ebffdb12496969dc2bb10ef8f59f43cd3"}, "language": "english", "review": "Lots of fun, I played it co-op with my 11 year old son and had a great time.", "timestamp_created": 1740167258, "timestamp_updated": 1740167258, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188414097", "author": {"steamid": "76561198128565110", "personaname": "Fedmedio", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/fedmedio/", "num_games_owned": 209, "num_reviews": 17, "playtime_forever": 3344, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1522, "last_played": 1749502958, "avatar": "ac5d38fab32adaa2ca63dfeeea5c79f90ae565bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Fun, entertaining!\r\nThe \"quest\" in the title is no fluke, the different quests motivate you to rerun the game multiple times.\r\nBranching route, excellent gunplay (and the amount of weapons) make each playthrough a unique experience\r\nFor fans of good rogue-likes definitely recommended!", "timestamp_created": 1740149897, "timestamp_updated": 1740149897, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188378702", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006524076", "personaname": "speed", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/lyingtothetruth/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 13748, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5688, "last_played": 1777227225, "avatar": "a280478fb0e8d21601af520c3c3bbfbe7d9e377d"}, "language": "english", "review": "I find myself coming back to this game to kill time, to blow off steam and to just have good, old-fashioned fun. This game reminds me of of playing a hard game as kid in the NES or SNES days. No micro-transactions, no BS. Just a good game with fantastic game play. You don't even need internet to play it. Wish there were more like it. Also, PLEASE KEEP ADDING CONTENT!!! I would even pay for updates!", "timestamp_created": 1740102425, "timestamp_updated": 1742669794, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "188376726", "author": {"steamid": "76561198021572000", "personaname": "Skaden", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/darfka/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 1296, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1296, "last_played": 1740099177, "avatar": "d0d398175b565d8a5e1fbe1527dbcf7eee4ea466"}, "language": "english", "review": "If you love fast paced FPS and roguelite, you certainly can't go wrong with Roboquest. Nice variety of class, perks, weapons, items. The side quest and meta unlock for progression are quite nice too. My biggest gripe would be that the game can start to feel a bit same-ish quicker than the other popular roguelite like Binding of Isaac or Dead Cells for instance. But still, it will take a while before you get to that point and the core gameplay stay super fun.", "timestamp_created": 1740099720, "timestamp_updated": 1740099720, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1597939791", "reactions": []}]}